      "locked": false,
      "x": 68,
      "y": 1043,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 180.0,
      "text": "The three original APIs require a matching API-scoped key.\nAPI policies validate the model and pin the backend.\nThe same key works over public or private ingress.\nA bearer token alone does not authorize these key APIs.",
